-{"id": "OB-GAP-091", "priority": "P1", "title": "P1 — CI Go leg red since 2026-09-21 22:45Z (first bad 13604b4 = merge of the OB-GAP-087/088/090 CI bundle): installing bwrap flipped the sandbox tests from SKIP to FAIL — 'bwrap: setting up uid map: Permission denied' (internal/sandbox TestSandbox_Run_RealBwrap + TestSandbox_Run_GitAvailable, internal/solver TestBSandboxRunner_RoundTrip); last green 1506776 at 22:28Z", "status": "pending", "reasoning": "Found by the coding-hermes supervisor (fleet cron, 2026-09-22 08:0x local) while triaging the fleet CI matrix.\n\n## What is red\nRepo `totalwindupflightsystems/off-by-one`, workflow run **35729895098** (2026-09-22T12:53:01Z, sha `07b5710f`), job `Go 1.26`, step `Test (short)` → `##[error]Process completed with exit code 1`.\nFailed tests (verbatim from `gh run view 35729895098 --log-failed`):\n\n    --- FAIL: TestSandbox_Run_RealBwrap (0.01s)\n        bwrap_test.go:203: run: exit status 1\n    --- FAIL: TestSandbox_Run_GitAvailable (0.00s)\n        bwrap_test.go:379: git --version: exit status 1 (stderr=bwrap: setting up uid map: Permission denied\n    --- FAIL: TestBSandboxRunner_RoundTrip (0.01s)\n        bsandbox_runner_test.go:78: Exec: exit status 1 (stdout= bwrap: setting up uid map: Permission denied )\n    FAIL github.com/totalwindupflightsystems/off-by-one/internal/sandbox  0.035s\n    FAIL github.com/totalwindupflightsystems/off-by-one/internal/solver   0.151s\n\n## When it started (run-level timeline)\n    2026-09-21T22:28:24Z  SUCCESS  1506776\n    2026-09-21T22:45:43Z  failure  13604b47   <= first red\n    2026-09-21T22:50:42Z  failure  d70b5057\n    2026-09-22T04:00:58Z  failure  1f449220\n    2026-09-22T10:01:09Z  failure  79b10f33\n    2026-09-22T12:53:01Z  failure  07b5710f\nSo main has been CI-red for ~13h at the time of filing.\n\n## Causality (this is a direct consequence of the OB-GAP-087 fix)\n`13604b4` = `merge: OB-GAP-087+088+090 CI honesty bundle (wt/OB-GAP-CI-BUNDLE)`; its substantive commit is\n`4e37192 ci: install bwrap for sandbox tests, honest go 1.26 matrix, grouped sqlite3 guard (OB-GAP-087, OB-GAP-088, OB-GAP-090)`.\nInstalling bubblewrap removed the *silent skip*: the sandbox tests now execute and immediately fail, because the runner cannot create the sandbox's user namespace (`setting up uid map: Permission denied`). CI became honest and red at the same moment. No product code changed — the red is a runner-capability mismatch that the tests do not detect.\n\n## Fix options (pick one, then keep the CI signal honest)\n1. **Capability-detect + explicit skip (preferred, runner-agnostic):** probe whether bwrap can actually set up its uid map (e.g. `bwrap --unshare-user --bind / / true` or a `CLONE_NEWUSER` probe) once in the sandbox package's test helper; when it is denied, `t.Skip(\"bwrap cannot create a user namespace here: setting up uid map: Permission denied (runner userns restricted)\")`. An explicit, reason-carrying skip keeps the honesty gain of OB-GAP-087 while restoring a meaningful green.\n2. **Give the runner the capability:** enable unprivileged user namespaces for the CI job (Ubuntu 24.04 restricts them via AppArmor; `kernel.apparmor_restrict_unprivileged_userns=0` and/or a userns-AppArmor profile for `bwrap`). Runner-image dependent — verify on the actual runner before relying on it.\nDo NOT revert the bwrap install: silently skipping again re-hides the sandbox path.\n\n## Relationship to other rows\n- **OB-GAP-087** (CI never exercises the bwrap sandbox paths — no bubblewrap install step) is now *inverted*: the paths are exercised and fail. Keep 087 closed as the fix that exposed this; this row is the follow-on that restores a truthful green.\n- **OB-GAP-090** (\"honest go 1.26 matrix\") is part of the same bundle — check whether the matrix change is implicated before touching the workflow again.\n\n## PASS criteria\nCI Go leg green on HEAD **and** the sandbox tests either run for real (uid map set up successfully) or skip with the explicit recorded reason above — no silent skip, no false red. Evidence to attach: the run URL + the skip reason line (or the passing sandbox tests).\n\n## Provenance\n- `gh run list -R totalwindupflightsystems/off-by-one --limit 14 --json databaseId,conclusion,createdAt,headSha`\n- `gh run view 35729895098 -R totalwindupflightsystems/off-by-one --log-failed`\n- `git -C /home/kara/off-by-one log --oneline -8 13604b47`, `git show --stat 13604b47`\nFiled by the fleet supervisor; no worker was dispatched for this row.", "detail": {"fingerprint": "c63f78aacb045a027134e2ee7b4dd17f0d18a0d0c79c37c540c96523a9478981"}, "complexity": 2, "created_at": "2026-09-22T13:08:56.031743+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-22T13:08:56.031743+00:00"}
